              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na meethyũũa na mambata na nzĩa ya Mbasani: na Oku mũsumbĩ wa Mbasani amaumaalĩla, we na andũ make onthe, kũkitĩa namo Etilei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
